{"item_uid": "指考101-history-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "臺灣人原本習於「日出而作，日入而息」的生活規律，在日本統治臺灣以後，臺人\n對於時間觀念的認知較為精確，這與下列哪一項變化最有關係？", "options": {"A": "工廠與學校普及", "B": "引進度量衡制度", "C": "機械力取代獸力", "D": "鐘錶行普遍出現"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 46.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 32.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 57.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 27.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 35.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 36.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 46.0, "p_high": 57.0, "p_low": 35.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [60.0, 50.0, 44.0, 40.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "某一時期，歐洲各地開始出現一種團體，成員須學習古典希臘哲學、基督教神學與\n人文學知識。後來，法學與醫學逐漸成為重要學習科目。這些成員學成後多擔任教\n師或進入政府與教會服務。這團體是：", "options": {"A": "行會", "B": "大學", "C": "修道院", "D": "皇家學會"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 90.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 41.0, "C": 42.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 90.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 49.0, "p_quintiles": [93.0, 84.0, 73.0, 58.0, 32.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "歷史教科書中描述某場戰爭：此為歐洲第一次大規模的國際戰爭，主要戰場在日耳\n曼地區，因而使該地的經濟遭到極大破壞，而戰後所簽訂的和約，不但影響到國際\n關係的發展，也確立國家獨立主權的原則。這場戰爭是：", "options": {"A": "三十年戰爭", "B": "七年戰爭", "C": "第一次世界大戰", "D": "第二次世界大戰"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 50.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 38.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 81.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 23.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 54.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 81.0, "p_low": 23.0, "discrimination": 58.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 66.0, 46.0, 31.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "一位學者指出：這個佛教宗派的主張，與傳統儒學重人文的理念趨同，大幅削弱佛教\n的宗教性質。這個宗派的興起與流行是中國佛教史上的重大發展。這個佛教宗派是指：", "options": {"A": "禪宗", "B": "天台宗", "C": "白蓮教", "D": "密宗"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 75.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 86.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 64.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 64.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 82.0, 76.0, 71.0, 61.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "甲午戰爭之後，「中學為體，西學為用」成為流行用語，在新式學堂及學會均以其\n作為辦學及創會的口號，然而新式學堂及學會的教學內容與發展目標，卻偏重於西\n學或新學。形成此一現象的原因，最可能是因為新式學堂及學會的創辦人：", "options": {"A": "多半是接受西方新式教育的留學生，對中國傳統文化較為陌生", "B": "多對中國傳統文化抱持否定的態度，認為它會阻礙西學的發展", "C": "多為外國人士或在華傳教士，自然會偏重於西學或新學的引介", "D": "多以「中學為體」作為對付保守勢力攻擊學堂及學會的擋箭牌"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 20.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 39.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 17.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 54.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 24.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 39.0, "p_high": 54.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [59.0, 46.0, 40.0, 32.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "五代時期，位於南方的楚國，曾大量種植一種盛行於唐代的商品作物，成為該國主\n要的經濟來源。楚國國君曾向梁太祖請求，每年上貢 25 萬斤，換取該項作物的販賣\n權，意即允許楚國將該項作物運至黃河南北，交換北方的衣料和戰馬，楚國因此獲\n利甚豐。該項商品作物是：", "options": {"A": "茶葉", "B": "棉花", "C": "罌粟", "D": "煙草"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 63.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 87.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 39.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 63.0, "p_high": 87.0, "p_low": 39.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 78.0, 64.0, 51.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "一位史家評論：「查士丁尼可算是最後一個真正的羅馬帝王；另一方面，他又是一\n個如假包換的拜占庭皇帝。」從羅馬帝王與拜占庭皇帝的差異判斷，下列哪一事項\n可以呼應查士丁尼是「一個如假包換的拜占庭皇帝」？", "options": {"A": "說出「皇詔就是法律」的名言", "B": "領導編成龐大的查士丁尼法典", "C": "積極恢復羅馬帝國的舊時疆域", "D": "重建君士坦丁堡並使用拉丁文"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 15.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 47.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 27.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 47.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 42.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 15.0, "p_high": 27.0, "p_low": 8.0, "discrimination": 19.0, "p_quintiles": [33.0, 16.0, 11.0, 9.0, 8.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "表 1 是「連續五年移入臺灣在戶口單位登記的人口數」，這最可能是哪個年代的統\n計？ 表 1 （單位：人）", "options": {"A": "1660年代", "B": "1680年代 第一年 第二年 第三年 第四年 第五年", "C": "1890年代", "D": "1940年代 7,915 26,922 34,339 98,580 303,707\n- 1 -\n101年指考 第 2 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 39.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 8.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 47.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 42.0, "D": 32.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 39.0, "p_high": 47.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 15.0, "p_quintiles": [51.0, 41.0, 37.0, 35.0, 30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "《詩經．衛風》：「瞻彼淇奧，綠竹猗猗」，可知上古中原地區產有竹子。史書記\n載：隋唐時期，在現今河南、陝西等地設有管理竹園的竹監司；到了宋代，僅鳳翔\n（屬陝西）設有監司；明初，黃河以北，已不見竹子大量種植。上述記載，最能印\n證歷史上的哪一現象或變遷？", "options": {"A": "竹子在人民生活中的重要性", "B": "東周到明代初年的氣候變化", "C": "政府對管理竹子種植的重視", "D": "東周到明代初年的經濟變化"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 52.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 40.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 61.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 26.0, "p_high": 46.0, "p_low": 12.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [53.0, 32.0, 22.0, 14.0, 11.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "有人認為：工廠工人的薪資只要能維持其生計即可，如果工資過高，工人生活改善，\n就會多生小孩，人口隨之增加；如此一來，勞動力便增加，工資隨之下降，甚至低\n於先前水準。我們應如何理解這種說法？", "options": {"A": "反映出中古時期行會對工資的看法", "B": "代表法國大革命前夕保守派的觀點", "C": "反映出十九世紀英國資本家的態度", "D": "代表二十世紀初俄國共產黨的主張"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 14.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 11.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 7.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 81.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 55.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 81.0, "p_low": 55.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [82.0, 77.0, 72.0, 64.0, 49.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "一位大學者的詩：「聞道西園春色深，急穿芒屩去登臨。千芭萬蕊爭紅紫，誰識乾\n坤造化心。」他要從春意盎然中體會「生意」的根源，也就是「天地生物之心」，\n藉以「識仁」。這種把自然與人心結合加以論述的學問應是：", "options": {"A": "漢代經學", "B": "唐代佛學", "C": "宋代理學", "D": "清代考據學"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 79.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 92.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 62.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 79.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 62.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 88.0, 83.0, 74.0, 55.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "顧炎武《日知錄》指出：唐代州縣政府，修築的城郭必皆寬廣，街道必皆正直，官\n署也多基址弘敞。而宋代以降，州縣政府所修築的城郭、街道和官署，則相對簡陋，\n且有越來越簡陋的趨勢。我們應該如何理解這種現象？", "options": {"A": "唐代國力強盛；宋代以降國力轉趨衰弱", "B": "唐代建築技術已達顛峰，後代難以超越", "C": "宋以後坊市制崩潰，無力維修城郭街道", "D": "宋代以降財政集權中央，地方經費困窘"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 12.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 55.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 64.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 46.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 55.0, "p_high": 64.0, "p_low": 46.0, "discrimination": 18.0, "p_quintiles": [67.0, 58.0, 54.0, 49.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "日本在一份文告中宣示：為帝國之自存與東亞之安寧，我們必須對該兩國宣戰。而\n一本歷史著作提到：日本為了快速跨出南進步伐，控制南太平洋，聲稱不惜與這兩\n國一戰。這兩份資料中所指的兩國是：", "options": {"A": "中、美", "B": "中、蘇", "C": "美、英", "D": "美、蘇"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 59.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 61.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 54.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 18.0, "p_high": 25.0, "p_low": 13.0, "discrimination": 12.0, "p_quintiles": [30.0, 17.0, 15.0, 14.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
