{"item_uid": "指考101-history-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "一位學者主張：國家、民族、語言與文化應該互為一體，國家是民族的本體，每個\n民族都受到召喚，建立國家。這種主張最可能出現在何時？", "options": {"A": "十五世紀初英法百年戰爭時", "B": "馬丁．路德發動宗教改革時", "C": "法王路易十四廢止南特詔書", "D": "十九世紀義、德建國運動時"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 13.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 75.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 15.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 83.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 60.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 83.0, "p_low": 60.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 82.0, 82.0, 77.0, 50.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "與洪秀全齊名的太平天國首領楊秀清，出身廣西，世代以燒炭種山為業，父母去世\n後，離家流浪，與人結夥護送洋貨，交結不少兩廣江湖豪客。後來因失業回到家鄉，\n仍作燒炭工人。楊秀清此時的「失業」，與某一城市的開港有關。這一城市應是：", "options": {"A": "廣州", "B": "上海", "C": "天津", "D": "南京"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 30.0, "B": 43.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 23.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 33.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 43.0, "p_high": 60.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 33.0, "p_quintiles": [64.0, 52.0, 42.0, 33.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "課堂上同學進行有關第一次世界大戰的專題報告時，討論起照片和繪畫兩種資料的\n價值。以下哪位同學的觀點最合理？\n甲：照片是科技產品，不會造假，是過去的真實翻版\n乙：繪畫是畫家所作，只要不虛構，便是過去的重現\n丙：照片和繪畫若非為當時人留下的作品，都不可信\n丁：照片和繪畫都不等於過去，而是通往過去的路徑", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 101年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 89.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 97.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 79.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 89.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 79.0, "discrimination": 18.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 95.0, 93.0, 87.0, 74.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "一位外國人前往某城市旅行，搭火車要先取得通行許可證明，才能買車票；到了目\n的地，看到滿城盡是腳踏車；在路邊攤買燒餅時，攤販向他要糧票。這位觀光客見\n到的景象最可能在：", "options": {"A": "1919年的上海", "B": "1936年的南京", "C": "1955年的香港", "D": "1970年的北京"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 27.0, "B": 30.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 30.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 16.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 48.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 35.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 30.0, "p_high": 48.0, "p_low": 17.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [55.0, 35.0, 26.0, 19.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "王元規是太原人，父親過世後，母親帶他回娘家。當地一位富豪，欲將女兒嫁給他。\n母親考慮自己的貧困處境，有意結此親事，當時才十二歲的王元規卻哭著說：「古\n人講究門當戶對，我們不能因為暫時住在這裡，就不顧身分。」母親覺得有道理，\n就婉拒了這門親事。這則故事反映出什麼樣的社會觀念？", "options": {"A": "這應是發生在西漢初年，反映當時的門第觀念", "B": "當時的世家子弟年紀雖幼，卻可自己決定婚事", "C": "地方富豪有意與高門子弟聯姻，提高社會地位", "D": "當時女性地位高漲，子女的婚姻全由母親決定"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 54.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 42.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 24.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 73.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 78.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 16.0, "discrimination": 57.0, "p_quintiles": [81.0, 57.0, 36.0, 22.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "某國科學家提出一份醫學報告，指出：該國人的尿液中無尿氮含量高達 20%，而其\n他人種只含 15%，這證明其人種的排泄物比其他人種潔淨，足見其種族更為進化與\n優越。這種看法最可能流行於何時？", "options": {"A": "十七世紀初期", "B": "十八世紀初期", "C": "十九世紀初期", "D": "二十世紀初期"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 41.0, "D": 38.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 37.0, "D": 55.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 43.0, "D": 21.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 38.0, "p_high": 55.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [60.0, 47.0, 38.0, 28.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "某時期中，道教開始盛行「神仙須下凡，歷經劫難」的想法，神仙須在人世行善立\n功，造福庶民，才能修得正果，重返天庭，位列仙班。這類故事反映道教因應當時\n社會變遷，因此強調參與、改善社會。這種社會變遷是指：", "options": {"A": "漢末工商瀕臨破產，故太平道要救濟生民", "B": "唐代門閥制度即將崩潰，故道教重視立功", "C": "宋代庶民社會崛起，故道教強調入世苦行", "D": "明清社會貧富不均，故道教提倡行善濟民"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 20.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 33.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 17.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 35.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 19.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 33.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 36.0, "p_high": 39.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 6.0, "p_quintiles": [41.0, 36.0, 36.0, 34.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "圖 1 為某一西班牙著名畫家的作品。從這幅繪畫的\n風格可推測出此藝術風潮產生的時期為何？", "options": {"A": "文藝復興時期", "B": "浪漫主義時期", "C": "法國大革命時期", "D": "戰間期 圖 1"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 67.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 89.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 41.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 67.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [93.0, 82.0, 70.0, 56.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "努爾哈赤創立八旗制度，分為滿洲、蒙古及漢軍八旗。但八旗制度亦可視個別需要\n而作調整，並無嚴格劃分界限；有漢軍改滿洲八旗者，有蒙古改漢軍八旗者，亦有\n蒙古改滿洲八旗者，甚至有同一家族分隸滿洲及漢軍八旗者。故入關後，一般人皆\n以「旗人」來通稱滿洲人。我們應如何解讀以上敘述？", "options": {"A": "滿洲人為顯示血統之純正，故「旗人」指的是通曉滿洲語的正統八旗軍人及其家屬", "B": "滿洲人及蒙古人地緣與血緣相近，故「旗人」指的是滿洲及蒙古八旗軍人及其家屬", "C": "滿洲人為籠絡漢人，允許漢人加入八旗，故「旗人」是指滿洲及漢軍八旗及其家屬", "D": "滿洲人為了塑造族群融和，混編八旗，故「旗人」是指滿、蒙及漢軍八旗及其家屬"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 59.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 18.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 70.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 46.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 59.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 46.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [73.0, 66.0, 60.0, 56.0, 40.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-024", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "牡丹社事件後，沈葆楨來臺善後，其善後某一政策的具體內容有：屯兵衛、刊林木、\n焚草萊、通水道、定壤則、招墾戶、給牛種、立村塾、設隘碉、致工商、設官吏、\n建城邦、設郵驛、置廨署等。此項政策應為：", "options": {"A": "開山", "B": "撫番", "C": "海防", "D": "吏治"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 56.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 30.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 73.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 38.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 42.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 65.0, 56.0, 47.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-025", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "有人說中國這一歷史事件，是一些知識分子聚在一起，講明聖學，闡發義理，激揚\n廉恥，使天下皆能尚氣節。國家滅亡後，這些知識分子，皆知捐軀效命，但求一死\n以求仁，可以說是「亡國有光」。但乾隆皇帝卻批評他們「始以正而終以亂」，是\n導致國家滅亡的禍首，怎麼能說是亡國的光榮呢？並感慨說：「真所謂國家將亡，\n必有妖孽」。這是指哪一歷史事件？", "options": {"A": "東漢的黨錮之禍", "B": "唐代的牛李黨爭", "C": "宋代的新舊黨爭", "D": "明代的東林黨爭\n- 3 -\n101年指考 第 4 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 56.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 14.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 73.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 38.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 66.0, 58.0, 49.0, 32.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "一位學者指出：有一個朝代，《史記》以〈殷本紀〉作為記載此一朝代歷史的篇章，\n唯「商」字實已出現於較《史記》更早的古本《竹書紀年》中。在甲骨刻辭中，「大\n邑商」也出現了不只一次，但卻從未出現過「殷」這個字。根據上述分析，這位學\n者主張此一朝代的人應自稱為：", "options": {"A": "殷人", "B": "商人", "C": "殷人或商人", "D": "中國人"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 9.0, "B": 84.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 96.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 84.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 68.0, "discrimination": 28.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 93.0, 89.0, 82.0, 60.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-027", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "同學以某個中東國家作為報告主題，他所收集的資料重點：甲、底格里斯河和幼發\n拉底河流經此處；乙、曾是數個古文明的發源地，首都在中世紀時是阿拉伯世界的\n中心；丙、1930 年代獨立，因石油礦藏豐富而享有一段和平時期；丁、1980 年代獨\n裁政權崛起，初始美國積極拉攏支持，藉此抗衡其他伊斯蘭國家。其後該政權與美\n國交惡，美國出兵攻打，自此控制該國內政。這個國家是：", "options": {"A": "敘利亞", "B": "埃及", "C": "伊拉克", "D": "土耳其"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 85.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 97.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 70.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 85.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 70.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 90.0, 82.0, 63.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-028", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 28, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "哲學家笛卡爾因其思想不見容於當道，被迫流亡他國。他於 1630 年代旅居某個城市\n時，稱讚道：「要找到世人所可能希冀的各種貨物和珍奇物品，世上還有哪個地方\n比這個城市更能讓人如願？」這個城市應是：", "options": {"A": "巴黎", "B": "日內瓦", "C": "阿姆斯特丹", "D": "佛羅倫斯"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 9.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 48.0, "D": 38.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 72.0, "D": 25.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 42.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 48.0, "p_high": 72.0, "p_low": 26.0, "discrimination": 46.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 58.0, 45.0, 34.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-029", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 29, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "為了參觀歷史博物館舉辦的「微笑彩俑－漢景帝的地下王國」，老師要求同學們先\n閱讀相關的背景資料。同學們應參考下列哪些圖書？\n甲、《春秋左氏傳》；乙、《春秋繁露》；丙、《戰國策》；丁、《史記》；戊、《漢書》", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "乙丙丁", "C": "丙丁戊", "D": "乙丁戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 35.0, "D": 55.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 79.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 50.0, "D": 33.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 55.0, "p_high": 79.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 46.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 68.0, 55.0, 42.0, 28.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "史家評論某地的歷史發展，指出：這個地方因具備良好的地理條件，當地人們繼承\n古代文化遺產，率先從中世紀轉變到近代，創造出新的時尚。「某地」是指：", "options": {"A": "西班牙", "B": "義大利", "C": "日耳曼", "D": "法蘭西"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 72.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 88.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 54.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 72.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 54.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 82.0, 74.0, 63.0, 49.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-031", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 31, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "政府往往透過修築鐵路帶動本國鋼鐵工業的發展，所採取的作法之一是對進口鋼鐵\n課徵較高的關稅，以保障本國鋼鐵工業的生產。民國以來，生產鋼鐵的漢冶萍公司\n僅於民國 5 至 8 年，獲有盈餘，其他時間都是虧損；11 年 ，漢陽鐵廠不堪虧損停工；\n14 年，開辦不久的大冶煉鐵廠也停工。根據上述說明及歷史背景，民國 5 至 8 年何\n以會有盈餘？其長期虧損的主要原因為何？", "options": {"A": "盈：因歐戰爆發，鋼鐵價格大漲；虧：不平等條約束縛，關稅不能自主", "B": "盈：機器由國外進口，設備新穎；虧：軍閥混戰，故無法繼續修建鐵路", "C": "盈：因歐戰爆發，鋼鐵價格大漲；虧：軍閥混戰，故無法繼續修建鐵路", "D": "盈：機器由國外進口，設備新穎；虧：不平等條約束縛，關稅不能自主"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 42.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 49.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 46.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 43.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 38.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 46.0, "p_low": 43.0, "discrimination": 3.0, "p_quintiles": [51.0, 37.0, 36.0, 42.0, 42.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-032", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 32, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "1960 到 1980 年代期間，臺灣的經濟發展深受世界矚目，甚至有「臺灣經驗」的美\n稱，其特色包括：出口導向的工業、經濟高度成長、國民所得迅速上升、對國際貿\n易高度依賴等。有學者認為：從經濟高度成長過程中所得分配並沒有惡化，其原因\n在於資本密集的重工業聘雇力較弱；相反的，勞力密集、輸出加工導向的產業聘雇\n力較強。由此可知，還有一個特色必須注意，此特色應為：", "options": {"A": "跨國公司及外資", "B": "眾多的中小企業", "C": "全面的自由經濟", "D": "金融開放國際化"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 24.0, "B": 61.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 15.0, "B": 80.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 32.0, "B": 42.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 61.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 42.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 72.0, 61.0, 50.0, 38.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-033", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 33, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "哥白尼寫到：「我確信，數學家們只要認真而不膚淺地研究，就會同意我的這些結\n論。…如果有人利用聖經某些段落攻擊我、歪曲我的原意，我會斷然予以拒絕。數\n學的真理只能由數學家來判斷。」伽利略表示：「哲學寫在宇宙這本大書裡面，為\n懂得這本書，人必須首先懂得它的語言和符號。它是以數學的語言寫成的，人若不\n具備這方面的知識，就無法懂得宇宙。」根據上文和你的歷史知識判斷，這兩位天\n文學者共同的觀點最可能是：", "options": {"A": "宇宙是本難以理解的大書", "B": "科學與宗教二者勢不兩立", "C": "聖經成為攻擊科學的利器", "D": "宇宙奧秘不能由教會獨斷\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 101年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 76.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 89.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 59.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 76.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 59.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 85.0, 80.0, 72.0, 53.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-034", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 34, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "某人認為：神的懲罰非常恐怖，為了免除世人的重罪，神先用瘟疫、飢荒、戰爭折\n磨世人。我們境內的子民越來越墮落，犯下無數罪行，才會受到疫病摧殘。我們應\n如何理解此一說法？", "options": {"A": "這是佛家輪迴之說，以解釋世間苦難的來源", "B": "這是十四世紀時，對黑死病發生原因的解釋", "C": "這是十七世紀的細菌學說，解釋疫病的來源", "D": "這是二十世紀蘇聯解體，共產主義者的警告"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 91.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 97.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 82.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 91.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 82.0, "discrimination": 15.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 96.0, 94.0, 91.0, 76.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-035", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 35, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "以下為有關人和神關係的三段資料。\n資料一：世人因為神賜的靈魂，才能領略神創造的世界；人的全部生命經歷都需通\n過信仰的解釋，才能顯示意義。\n資料二：人無法自己掙得拯救，上帝自動將拯救賜予信仰祂的人；人只有直接對上\n帝負責，才能自由體驗上帝的恩寵。\n資料三：個人是獨特、理性和有創造性的；每個人的特性都是神賜，但每個人充分\n發揮自己特長才是對神的最高尊崇。\n這三段資料分別來自不同時期的作者，他們依序是：", "options": {"A": "人文主義者、中世紀基督徒、路德教徒", "B": "中世紀基督徒、路德教徒、人文主義者", "C": "路德教徒、中世紀基督徒、人文主義者", "D": "路德教徒、人文主義者、中世紀基督徒"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 69.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 84.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 49.0, "C": 41.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 48.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [87.0, 81.0, 75.0, 64.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-036", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 36, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "東漢末年，一位生於豫州的月氏僧人支謙來到吳地，翻譯多部經書。孫權稱帝之後，\n請支謙輔佐太子，西元 241 年太子死，支謙隱遁。另一位生於交阯郡的康居僧人康\n僧會於西元 247 年，初抵建業，孫權為他建立建初寺，「江南大法遂興」。兩位僧\n人均以譯經著稱，譯文典雅，常掇拾中華名詞與理論摻入經文。根據上文可知，江\n南佛教開始於何時？支謙與康僧會譯經何以有上述特色？", "options": {"A": "建初寺設立之前；他們都是出身西域的僧人", "B": "建初寺設立之前；他們都生於中土深受華化", "C": "建初寺設立之時；他們都是出身西域的僧人", "D": "建初寺設立之時；他們都生於中土深受華化"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 28.0, "B": 40.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 20.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 20.0, "B": 51.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 34.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 19.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 40.0, "p_high": 51.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [55.0, 44.0, 39.0, 34.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-037", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 37, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "閱讀下列兩則資料，回答問題。\n資料一：一位傳教士寫信向教會報告宣教成果：「某些地區，百分之八十的居民接\n受了基督教教義，其中半數會閱讀並使用羅馬拼音文字。」\n資料二：一位清代人的回憶：「原來我們沒有文字，傳教士來後幫我們創造一套文字，\n這套文字在傳教士離開後，我們在土地契約上，繼續使用至少一百五十年。」\n下列有關這兩則資料的解讀，哪些是正確的？", "options": {"A": "兩則資料內容和荷蘭傳教士在臺傳教有關", "B": "兩則資料所指的傳教士是指耶穌會傳教士", "C": "兩則資料所指的文字是指岸里社語和文書", "D": "「地區」和「我們」是指宜蘭的噶瑪蘭族", "E": "「地區」和「我們」是指南部的西拉雅族\n- 5 -\n101年指考 第 6 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 93.0, "B": 43.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 12.0, "E": 86.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 97.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 2.0, "E": 97.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 86.0, "B": 57.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 26.0, "E": 70.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 66.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 48.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 76.0, 68.0, 60.0, 41.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-038", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 38, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "歐洲中世紀羅馬教宗在西歐社會中的氣勢與威望曾經盛極一時。以下哪些事件可為印證？", "options": {"A": "法蘭克王丕平於 756年征服義大利的倫巴底人，並將所獲土地贈予教宗", "B": "神聖羅馬帝國皇帝鄂圖一世於963 年廢黜教宗約翰十二世，並立新教宗", "C": "教宗格里高利七世於1076年宣告開除神聖羅馬帝國皇帝亨利四世的教籍", "D": "教宗烏爾本二世於1095 年發動十字軍聖戰，獲得社會各階層熱烈迴響", "E": "馬丁路德於1517年批評教宗：「他是耶穌的敵人，他反耶穌之道而行」"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 80.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 87.0, "D": 92.0, "E": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 90.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 98.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 66.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 74.0, "D": 82.0, "E": 22.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 91.0, "p_low": 52.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 89.0, 83.0, 71.0, 40.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-039", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 39, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "《史記．匈奴列傳》記載：匈奴人逐水草而居，沒有城郭。天性嗜利，男人組成甲\n騎，經常越界掠奪漢人。有一次，一位漢朝使臣訪問匈奴時，批評匈奴習俗貴壯賤\n老，所有食物由青壯者先食用；若兄弟去世時，需接收兄弟之妻為妻。匈奴接待者\n表示，青壯者必先吃飽，才能保護部落安全；要接收兄弟之妻，是為了避免孤兒寡\n婦流離失所，這些作法有實際的社會功能。我們如何解讀這段記載？", "options": {"A": "匈奴為漢朝之敵，司馬遷對匈奴的記載都出於宣傳，故不可信", "B": "司馬遷受朝廷腐刑，他藉匈奴官員之口美化匈奴，所言不可信", "C": "司馬遷的記載雖站在漢人立場，但所記匈奴之事，有事實依據", "D": "匈奴自身無文字，《史記》記載成為了解匈奴歷史的依據之一", "E": "匈奴官員的解釋說明農業和游牧文明生活方式與價值觀的差異"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 93.0, "D": 87.0, "E": 92.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 97.0, "D": 91.0, "E": 99.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 87.0, "D": 81.0, "E": 82.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 87.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 76.0, "discrimination": 19.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 93.0, 92.0, 88.0, 69.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-history-040", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 40, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "以下是有關古巴危機的兩份資料。\n資料一：1980 年出版的歷史著作提到：「甘迺迪贏了！蘇聯政府退讓，同意拆除飛\n彈基地並移回蘇聯。危機發生三個月後，美國也拆除土耳其和義大利領土\n的所有飛彈。」\n資料二：1971 出版的《赫魯雪夫回憶錄》寫到：「我們告訴美國人我們同意拆除飛\n彈，前提是總統要保證不會入侵古巴。最後甘迺迪讓步了。這是蘇聯外交\n政策的一大勝利，無需一槍一彈的傲人成就。」\n這兩份資料對最後哪方獲勝有不同看法，我們應如何解讀？", "options": {"A": "資料一的論述較正確，因記載的內容都是歷史事實", "B": "資料二的論述較正確，因出版時間與古巴危機較近", "C": "兩份資料中都呈現了美蘇兩國同意拆除飛彈的訊息", "D": "兩份資料沒有相同的訊息，可見兩份資料均為造假", "E": "兩份資料的論點不同，但都有他們各自論述的目的"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 91.0, "D": 2.0, "E": 96.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 93.0, "D": 0.0, "E": 100.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 90.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 86.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 72.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 95.0, 92.0, 85.0, 64.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
